message: "If you use TCT in research or build on it in your own work, please cite this repository as software and identify the commit and configuration used."
type: software
title: "TCT: Type-Constrained Tokenization"
authors:
  - family-names: Schmitt
    given-names: Jonas
repository-code: "https://github.com/jonas-schmitt/tct"
url: "https://github.com/jonas-schmitt/tct"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  TCT compiles JSON Schemas into schema-specific tokenizers and generated Rust
  codecs, with Python wheel packaging and BPE compression over TCT token streams.
keywords:
  - tokenization
  - JSON Schema
  - code generation
  - structured generation
